oast \\\"Review Submitted!\\\". Review persisted (restaurantId \\\"3\\\", rating 5) and appears in that restaurant's reviews list as \\\"QA Tester T / Visited Aug 20, 2026 / rating-5-of-5\\\"; detail count went (1)→(2). The Golden Fork detail still shows (2) reviews and does not contain \\\"QA Tester T\\\".\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-6\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Applied WELCOME10 → toast \\\"Coupon Applied! 10% off your first reservation\\\"; UI replaced input with reservation.coupon.applied=\\\"WELCOME10\\\" and reservation.coupon.discount=\\\"- 20%/-10% off\\\". Remove button restored the empty coupon input. After submit, stored reservation contains \\\"couponCode\\\":\\\"WELCOME10\\\".\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-7\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Calendar (Aug 2026) renders all gridcells 1–28 as [disabled] (today 2026-08-28 and earlier); 29 onward selectable. Selected Sep 2, 2026 + available time 19:00; form state reads date=\\\"Sep 2, 2026\\\", time=\\\"19:00\\\".\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-8\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Reservation date cannot be modified — the Modify dialog offers no date control\", \"actual\": \"The \\\"Modify Reservation\\\" dialog contains only \\\"New Time\\\" and \\\"Party Size\\\" comboboxes plus Save Changes/Close (accessibility snapshot of [role=dialog] shows no date picker, and semantic_snapshot of the dialog lists only .modify.time and .modify.party-size). Time 19:00→20:30 and party 2→6 saved correctly and the card updated to \\\"September 2, 2026 / 20:30 / 6 Guests\\\", but the date is unchangeable, so date changes cannot be submitted or displayed.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-10\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"No completed-reservation gating on review submission; reviews can be posted by anyone, unlimited times\", \"actual\": \"On Trattoria Bella (restaurant 3) the user had no reservation of any kind (tablespot_reservations contained only one cancelled reservation for restaurant 1). The \\\"Write a Review\\\" tab and form were fully available and submitting produced \\\"Review Submitted! Thank you for sharing your experience.\\\" with the review persisted and displayed. There is no reservation check and no one-review-per-completed-reservation limit anywhere in the flow.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-11\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"WEEKEND20 coupon's day-of-week eligibility rule is not enforced\", \"actual\": \"With reservation date Sep 2, 2026 (a Wednesday — calendar row \\\"30 31 1 2 3 4 5\\\" maps 2 to the We column) and party size 2, applying WEEKEND20 succeeded: toast \\\"Coupon Applied! 20% off weekend dining\\\" and reservation.coupon.applied=\\\"WEEKEND20\\\", discount \\\"- 20% off\\\". A weekend-only coupon was accepted on a weekday. (GROUP15 correctly rejected with \\\"This coupon requires a party of 6 or more.\\\"; only one coupon can be held at a time since the code input is replaced by the applied-coupon row.)\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-13\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Missing/invalid reservation input is silently rejected with no user-facing error message\", \"actual\": \"Clicking \\\"Confirm Reservation\\\" with a completely empty form does nothing: no toast (MutationObserver on document.body captured no notification node), no inline text, no aria-invalid/role=alert element, and localStorage tablespot_reservations stays \\\"[]\\\". Same silent no-op when date=Sep 2 2026, time=19:00, name and phone filled but email=\\\"not-an-email\\\" — reservation is correctly blocked, but the user is never told which field is missing or invalid.\", \"evidence\": \"reservation.form innerText after failed submit contains no error string; document.querySelectorAll('[aria-invalid],[data-error],[role=alert]') inside the form returned [].\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-14\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Modify opens a dialog whose supported changes (time, party size) save successfully with toast \\\"Reservation Updated\\\". Cancel opens an explicit \\\"Cancel Reservation?\\\" alertdialog with Keep Reservation / Cancel Reservation; clicking Keep left status=\\\"confirmed\\\" and Upcoming (1) unchanged, only the explicit confirm applied the cancellation.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-15\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Create → toast \\\"Reservation Confirmed!\\\" + confirmation panel; Modify → toast \\\"Reservation Updated\\\" and card immediately showed 20:30 / 6 Guests; Cancel → toast \\\"Reservation Cancelled\\\" and tab counts flipped to Upcoming (0)/Past (1) in the same session, all without any page reload.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-16\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Separate tabs \\\"Upcoming (1)\\\" / \\\"Past (0)\\\". Card text: \\\"The Golden Fork / French · $$$$ / Upcoming / September 2, 2026 / 19:00 / 2 Guests / Downtown / Coupon applied: WELCOME10\\\" — restaurant, date, time, party size, status, location and applied coupon all present.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-17\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Restaurant list rating is static and inconsistent with the review-derived rating shown on the detail page; list is not updated by new reviews\", \"actual\": \"The Golden Fork: list card shows 4.8, detail shows 4.5 (2 reviews of 5 and 4). Trattoria Bella: list card showed 4.5 while detail showed 4.0 with (1) review. After submitting a 5-star review for Trattoria Bella the detail correctly updated to 4.5 / (2) reviews, but the list card still displayed the unchanged static 4.5. The list also shows no review count at all, so counts cannot be compared between views.\", \"evidence\": null}]}"
